@module missiles ; Dameron's missiles: 8 records of 6 bytes at $7000
@about A missile record (HudPicture $7000 + 6n, n = 0-7; $FF at +0 free): +0 the column, +1 the line (from line 48: ScreenLineTable + $60), +2 the kind, +3 the frame or the path, +4 the step. Kinds: 1 a fireball (3 x 16, frames 0-3), 2 an arcing shot along ArcSteps0-3 (MoveCurvedShot $9DC6), 3 a bolt (3 x 9, frames 8-11), 4 a burst (3 x 24, frames $13-$17, placed by NextDameronForm $A0C4 when a form is beaten). Frame n is at SpriteBank $B3BA + the word n of SpriteFrameOffsets $938E (SpriteFrameAddress $9378). Every missile is tested against the hero first (CheckShotHitsHero $A33E: C = 9 damage); kinds 1-3 move one column left every other pass and are freed at column -1 (FreeShot $A015).
$7F10 c ClearMissiles ; Free Dameron's missiles: fill $7000-$707F with $FF
> 128 bytes of $FF (LDIR), more than the 8 records x 6 bytes UpdateDameronMissiles reads (FindFreeMissile may write a ninth record at MissilesEnd $7030, inside this area). Called once by StageEntry.
> Witness: L1 3 (ending, rzx-r5, s5-right).

