> For n = 16 down to 1 at Stars $BA86: +1 = (a Random $9492 byte under $90) + $30 AND $F8, +0 = n x 16 (n = 16 gives 0); a second Random $9492 call only advances the ROM pointer. Called once by StageEntry.
