> WELL DONE. / YOUR TASK / IS COMPLETE. / HISTORY IS / RESTORED AND / DAMERON IS / BANISHED. Read once by DrawEndingText (DrawTextLine); shown by ShowEnding once Dameron is beaten (phase 4). The text is drawn into the second page at the stage start (read once in every recording); rzx-r5 and ending reached the ending page (ShowEnding $8CEF 841 and 3284 passes).
