$B636 SpriteBank14 ; frame 14
$B67E SpriteBankSpare ; 72 bytes between frames 14 and 15 that no offset names: a frame no code draws
$B6C6 SpriteBank15 ; frame 15
@res stage5/bitmaps-bank-3x24.bin

$B94E s UnusedB94E ; 2 zero bytes no code reads

$B950 b BitMasks 8 ; One bit a byte, bit 7 to bit 0 ($80, $40 ... $01): no reader
> No operand of stage 5's code names $B950-$B957 and no word in the code area points there (checked over $7800-$A366); no recording (s5-right, rzx-r5, ending) reads any of it. Known only from the bytes.

$B958 b ItemIcons16 2 ; The item icons: 8 icons of 2 bytes x 16 lines (32 bytes each)
> DrawItemIcon $7DD0 copies the icon ItemIcons $7E8B names for the kind (kind 2 and 7 $B958, 6 ItemIcon6 $B978, 5 ItemIcon5 $B998, 3 ItemIcon3 $B9B8, 8 ItemIcon8 $B9D8, 1 ItemIcon1 $B9F8, 0 ItemIcon0 $BA38; kind 4 is the blank BlankIcon $94B0). The icon at ItemIconSpare $BA18 has no kind: no word names it. s5-right reads ItemIcon8 $B9D8 (kind 8, the item the hero starts with) and ItemIcon0 $BA38.
$B978 ItemIcon6 ; kind 6
$B998 ItemIcon5 ; kind 5
$B9B8 ItemIcon3 ; kind 3
$B9D8 ItemIcon8 ; kind 8: the starting item (StartItems slot 6)
$B9F8 ItemIcon1 ; kind 1
$BA18 ItemIconSpare ; no kind names it
$BA38 ItemIcon0 ; kind 0
@res stage5/bitmaps-item-icons-2x16.bin

$BA58 s UnusedBA58 ; 32 zero bytes no code reads

$BA78 b EnergyBarPattern 6 ; The energy bar's pattern: 6 bytes, the same on each of the bar's 6 lines
> DrawEnergyBar $9744 copies its whole bytes and a last partial byte (BarMasks $979D) to the HUD at EnergyBarScreen $4134, six lines, by the energy. Read in s5-right (138 lines drawn).
